## Optional native graphics runtime and probes

- The optional native graphics runtime and probes use separately supplied SDKs;
  no SDK, runtime dylib, shader compiler binary, or game shader is bundled into
  wire or Wire.app by this change. Audited 2026-10-08:
  - MoltenVK v1.4.2 public-API macOS release (Apache-2.0), separately dynamically
    loaded by src/platform/native_graphics.cpp and tools/moltenvk_probe.c.
    https://github.com/KhronosGroup/MoltenVK
    Official archive SHA-256:
    f95765a6229cb7b915990a2890ce12ebe36a730b021545d3d52ae69ce4c4024e
  - Vulkan Headers 1.4.357 (Apache-2.0 OR MIT; MIT selected), supplied by that SDK.
    Copyright 2015-2026 The Khronos Group Inc. No header source is vendored.
    https://github.com/KhronosGroup/Vulkan-Headers
  - dxbc-spirv c7f069701227dcb800a01bd93e42f8001b7543e7 (MIT), compiled unchanged
    as an ARM64 static library linked by the optional host shim, and as a
    standalone tool invoked by tools/probe_dxbc.py.
    Copyright (c) 2025 Philip Rebohle.
    https://github.com/doitsujin/dxbc-spirv
  - Its SPIR-V Headers c8ad050fcb29e42a2f57d9f59e97488f465c436d unified headers
    (MIT; actual compiled files), Copyright 2014-2024 The Khronos Group Inc.
    https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Headers
  tools/build_native_graphics.py builds the independently implemented LGPL
  libwire_graphics.dylib. Rust loads it only with explicit probe64
  --graphics-backend / --moltenvk paths. License texts are preserved in
  licenses/third-party/. Redistribution of these optional binaries also needs
  the concrete MoltenVK package's NOTICE and dependency notices, the compiler
  and SPIR-V Headers notices, and LGPL rebuild/replacement materials.
  For the macOS DXVK/native source review and future runtime integration limits,
  see docs/d3d11-dxvk-moltenvk-design.md. No DXVK implementation is currently
  linked into the default runtime or Wire.app. The optional shader compiler is
  now linked into the explicit native helper; MoltenVK stays a separate dynamic
  component. Win64 DXGI COM code is independently implemented; GUID/layout/slot
  facts were checked against fixed DXVK Native directx headers, and D3D12
  ordinals against Wine 10.0 d3d12.spec. Those files are not copied.
  src/platform/native_geometry.h implements GS-to-compute lowering independently
  through the unchanged compiler's IR API. tests/native_graphics/geometry_fixtures.cpp
  contains original test shaders and calls its parser/signature/DXBC hash helpers.
  No upstream shader, lowering implementation or source patch is copied.

